# WoW addon AI — workflow

Canonical multi-tool contract: repository root `AGENTS.md` (also used by Claude, Copilot, Gemini, Windsurf). Read `06-notes/addon-dev/ai-assisted-best-practices.md` before substantial addon authoring.

## Client truth

- **Forever** = Interface `16001`, Mainline-family (Camelot), secrets + modern `C_*` — not Classic Era
- **Midnight** = Interface `120105` / `120107` — secrets, no addon CLEU
- When sources disagree: client generated docs and in-game `/dump` win (see README "Which source to trust")
- After TOC edits: full client restart. After Lua-only: `/reload`

## Default engineering

- Smallest correct change; avoid Ace3 unless config/profile complexity needs it
- Init SavedVariables on `ADDON_LOADED` with addon-name check
- Set `OnEvent` before `RegisterEvent`
- Security + performance checklists in `06-notes/addon-dev/security-and-trust.md` and `performance-and-resources.md` are merge gates
- State what was not tested in-game; never claim "should work" without evidence

